 "level_notes": {
  "1": "SDL-2010 is defined by the free ITU-T Recommendations Z.100 (overview) to Z.107; earlier versions (SDL-88, SDL-92, SDL-2000) carried a formal semantics annex (Z.100 Annex F).",
  "0": "Commercial tools (IBM Rational SDL Suite, PragmaDev) dominate; OpenGEODE (ESA, Python) is an open-source SDL editor and Ada code generator.",
  "3": "The PLDB 'sdl' page describes an unrelated language (Shared Dataspace Language) and is therefore omitted."
